// Shared config for the Pariksha (Vidhya Vikashni coaching-test) ingestion pipeline.
//
// Source: ParikshaGruh print-question-paper PDFs under SOURCE_ROOT (c:\tmp\pariksha),
// generated by Vidhya Vikashni Mat. Hr. Sec. School (Tiruppur) — a NEET coaching centre.
// These are COACHING PRACTICE tests, NOT past-year papers → they land under the existing
// NEET exam with question_kind='practice' (kept off the PYQ surfaces by that axis), reusing
// NEET's Physics/Chemistry/Botany/Zoology subjects + the NCERT chapter catalog.
//
// Format quirks (see README.md):
//   • Image-based — the text layer holds only question numbers; stems/options/figures are
//     rendered as image fragments → VISION transcription (like NEET/Foundation).
//   • Two-up layout — each PDF page holds TWO logical print-pages side by side (footer
//     "1/11", "2/11"). render.ts splits each PDF page into a LEFT and RIGHT logical page.
//   • Answer keys — the "+"/answer files print `Answer : X` in the TEXT layer, one per
//     question, in continuous 1..N order across sections. extract-keys.ts pulls these
//     verbatim (exact, no vision needed). 7 tests have NO key → answers derived + flagged.
//   • Filenames are noisy (duplicates + a couple mislabels); this registry pins ONE
//     canonical file per Test Id.
import { join } from "node:path";

